 + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":522103.9,"ev_to_ebitda":6.6,"debt_to_ebitda":0.09,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-0.28,"f_score":8,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 57.1%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $61,778M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 24.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.59"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":79.55,"default_fair_val":79.55,"premium_pct":87.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":8.2,"pe_forward":7.2,"pb_trailing":6.2,"pb_forward":5.6,"div_yield":0.14,"ps_ratio":4.3,"fcf_to_ev":6.08,"fcf_to_mcap":5.83,"liab_to_assets":24.7,"cash_to_assets":25,"current_ratio":2.59,"roe":75.8,"roa":57.1,"moat":{"ticker":"SKHY","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SK海力士作為全球領先的記憶體晶片製造商，其品牌在產業內具有相當的聲譽與識別度。然而，記憶體產業本質上產品同質性高，品牌溢價空間相對有限，主要客戶（如伺服器、手機大廠）更看重產品效能、穩定性與價格。因此，雖然品牌有助於建立信任與初步篩選，但定價權並非其最強壁壘。與競爭對手如三星、美光相比，SK海力士的品牌影響力雖強，但尚未達到能獨立於市場供需制定高價的程度。其品牌價值更多體現在技術領先與可靠供應的承諾上。","comment_en":"SK hynix, as a leading global memory chip manufacturer, possesses considerable reputation and recognition within the industry. However, the memory industry is inherently characterized by high product homogeneity, limiting the scope for brand premium. Major customers (e.g., server and mobile giants) prioritize product performance, stability, and price. Therefore, while the brand helps build trust and initial screening, pricing power is not its strongest moat. Compared to competitors like Samsung and Micron, SK hynix's brand influence is strong but has not yet reached a level where it can dictate high prices independently of market supply and demand. Its brand value is more reflected in its commitment to technological leadership and reliable supply."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"記憶體產業的技術迭代快速，專利布局是維持競爭力的關鍵。SK海力士在DRAM和NAND Flash等核心技術領域擁有大量的專利組合，涵蓋製程、架構及新技術開發。這些專利構成了一定的進入壁壘，使得新進者難以繞過現有技術而快速複製。雖然專利本身無法完全阻止競爭，但能有效延緩對手追趕步伐，並在專利訴訟中提供防禦籌碼。此外，半導體產業的生產認證與合規要求嚴格，也間接形成了一道無形的門檻，SK海力士憑藉其長期營運經驗，在此方面具有優勢。","comment_en":"The memory industry is characterized by rapid technological iteration, making patent portfolio management crucial for maintaining competitiveness. SK hynix holds a substantial patent portfolio in core technology areas such as DRAM and NAND Flash, covering manufacturing processes, architectures, and new technology development. These patents form a certain barrier to entry, making it difficult for newcomers to quickly replicate without circumventing existing technologies. While patents alone cannot completely prevent competition, they can effectively slow down competitors' progress and provide defensive leverage in patent litigation. Furthermore, the stringent certification and compliance requirements in the semiconductor industry also indirectly create an intangible hurdle, where SK hynix benefits from its long-standing operational experience."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於終端客戶而言，更換記憶體供應商並非易事。一旦客戶（如伺服器品牌、手機製造商）將SK海力士的產品整合到其設計與生產流程中，重新驗證、測試和調整產線將耗費大量時間與資源。這種整合的深度使得客戶在選擇供應商時會傾向於長期合作，以確保產品的穩定性與供應鏈的連續性。儘管如此，記憶體作為關鍵零組件，客戶仍會尋求性價比最高的選擇，若有顯著的價格或技術差異，仍有可能發生轉換，因此轉換成本雖高，但非絕對。","comment_en":"For end customers, switching memory suppliers is not a trivial matter. Once a customer (e.g., server brands, mobile manufacturers) integrates SK hynix's products into their design and production processes, re-validation, testing, and production line adjustments incur significant time and resources. This depth of integration leads customers to favor long-term partnerships when selecting suppliers, ensuring product stability and supply chain continuity. Nevertheless, as memory is a critical component, customers will still seek the best value for money. If there are significant price or technological differences, switching may still occur, thus while switching costs are high, they are not absolute."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"記憶體產業的網絡效應相對薄弱。SK海力士的產品主要銷售給大型設備製造商，其價值體現在晶片本身的性能和可靠性上，而非用戶端的網絡效應。雖然與主要客戶建立的長期合作關係可以視為一種網絡的延伸，但這更多是基於信任和供應穩定性，而非典型的網絡效應，即用戶越多，產品價值越高的情況。SK海力士的競爭優勢更多來自於技術、規模和成本，而非由用戶數量增長帶來的價值飛輪。","comment_en":"Network effects in the memory industry are relatively weak. SK hynix's products are primarily sold to large equipment manufacturers, and their value lies in the performance and reliability of the chips themselves, rather than user-side network effects. While long-term partnerships with key customers can be seen as an extension of a network, this is more based on trust and supply stability rather than typical network effects where more users lead to increased product value. SK hynix's competitive advantages stem more from technology, scale, and cost, rather than a value flywheel driven by user growth."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"SK海力士作為全球前兩大的記憶體製造商之一，其規模經濟效應顯著。龐大的生產規模使得公司能夠攤薄研發、製程優化和廠房建置的固定成本，從而在單位生產成本上取得優勢。這種規模優勢在資本密集且週期性強的半導體產業中尤為重要，能夠在市場景氣下獲得更高的利潤，並在市場低迷時承受更大的壓力，甚至擠壓小型競爭對手的生存空間。持續的製程技術領先和產能擴張，進一步鞏固了其成本領先地位。","comment_en":"As one of the top two global memory manufacturers, SK hynix benefits from significant economies of scale. Its massive production scale allows the company to spread fixed costs associated with R&D, process optimization, and fab construction, leading to a cost advantage per unit. This scale advantage is particularly crucial in the capital-intensive and cyclical semiconductor industry, enabling higher profits during market upturns and greater resilience during downturns, potentially squeezing out smaller competitors. Continuous leadership in process technology and capacity expansion further solidifies its cost-leading position."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"SK海力士的生產基地主要集中在韓國，並在全球設有研發和銷售據點。雖然其生產設施是高度專業化且資本密集的資產，但地理位置本身並非構成獨特的護城河。記憶體產業的全球化供應鏈和客戶基礎意味著，地理位置的優勢更多體現在物流效率和貼近客戶的服務能力上，而非像某些資源型產業那樣，擁有特定地理位置的稀缺性。其核心競爭力在於技術和製造能力，而非地理位置的獨特性。","comment_en":"SK hynix's manufacturing facilities are primarily concentrated in South Korea, with R&D and sales operations globally. While its production facilities are highly specialized and capital-intensive assets, the geographical location itself does not constitute a unique moat. The globalized supply chain and customer base of the memory industry mean that geographical advantages are more related to logistics efficiency and proximity to customers, rather than scarcity of a specific location as seen in some resource-based industries. Its core competitiveness lies in its technology and manufacturing capabilities, not in the uniqueness of its geographical assets."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SK海力士展現出卓越的營運效率，這從其極高的ROE（75.8%）和ROA（57.1%）以及強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $61,778.4M）可見一斑。公司能夠在高度競爭且週期性的半導體市場中，持續實現高於行業平均的盈利能力，這歸功於其先進的製程技術、嚴格的成本控制以及對生產流程的精確管理。高營運效率不僅體現在財務數據上，也意味著公司能更有效地將資本投入轉化為利潤，並在市場波動時保持較強的韌性。","comment_en":"SK hynix demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency, evident from its very high ROE (75.8%) and ROA (57.1%), as well as strong Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $61,778.4M). The company consistently achieves profitability above the industry average in the highly competitive and cyclical semiconductor market, attributable to its advanced process technology, stringent cost controls, and precise management of production processes. High operational efficiency is not only reflected in financial metrics but also signifies the company's ability to more effectively convert capital investments into profits and maintain strong resilience amidst market fluctuations."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SK海力士展現出穩健的資本配置能力。公司擁有充裕的現金儲備（$56,211.9M）且負債水平相對較低（$13,632.1M），財務結構健康。其高額的自由現金流顯示了強大的內生造血能力，為其研發投入、產能擴張以及股東回報提供了堅實基礎。儘管記憶體產業週期性強，但公司似乎能較好地平衡資本支出與現金回流，並在適當時機進行戰略性投資。管理層在維持公司長期增長潛力與財務穩健之間取得了良好平衡。","comment_en":"SK hynix exhibits robust capital allocation capabilities. The company possesses ample cash reserves ($56,211.9M) with a relatively low debt level ($13,632.1M), indicating a healthy financial structure. Its substantial free cash flow demonstrates strong internal cash generation, providing a solid foundation for R&D investments, capacity expansion, and shareholder returns. Despite the cyclical nature of the memory industry, the company appears to balance capital expenditures with cash flow effectively and makes strategic investments at appropriate times. Management has achieved a good balance between maintaining the company's long-term growth potential and financial stability."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SK海力士透過提供高品質、高性能的記憶體產品，並與主要客戶建立長期穩定的合作夥伴關係，實現了較高的客戶黏性。如前所述，記憶體產品的整合難度導致客戶轉換成本較高，這有助於維持現有客戶群。此外，公司持續的技術創新和產品升級，能夠滿足客戶不斷變化的需求，進一步鞏固客戶關係。雖然產業競爭激烈，但SK海力士憑藉其可靠的供應能力和技術實力，在主要客戶群中保持了相當高的忠誠度。","comment_en":"SK hynix achieves relatively high customer stickiness by providing high-quality, high-performance memory products and establishing long-term, stable partnerships with major clients. As mentioned earlier, the integration complexity of memory products leads to high switching costs for customers, which helps retain the existing customer base. Furthermore, the company's continuous technological innovation and product upgrades meet the evolving needs of its customers, further solidifying client relationships. Despite intense industry competition, SK hynix maintains considerable loyalty among its key customer base due to its reliable supply capabilities and technological prowess."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"記憶體產業雖然週期性強，但其作為數位經濟的基礎設施，長期需求趨勢向上。SK海力士憑藉其在DRAM和NAND Flash領域的技術領先地位、規模經濟優勢以及穩健的財務狀況，展現了較強的長期抗壓能力與韌性。公司能夠在產業低谷期生存並持續投資，這得益於其卓越的營運效率和資本配置能力。只要能持續跟隨或引領技術趨勢，並有效管理週期波動，SK海力士有望在可預見的未來保持其競爭優勢，其商業模式具有相當的持久性。","comment_en":"Although the memory industry is highly cyclical, it serves as the infrastructure for the digital economy, with a long-term upward demand trend. SK hynix, with its technological leadership in DRAM and NAND Flash, economies of scale, and solid financial position, demonstrates strong long-term resilience and durability. The company's ability to survive and continue investing during industry downturns is attributed to its excellent operational efficiency and capital allocation capabilities. As long as it can continue to follow or lead technological trends and effectively manage cyclical fluctuations, SK hynix is expected to maintain its competitive advantages in the foreseeable future, indicating considerable durability in its business model."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"SK海力士憑藉其在記憶體領域的技術領先、龐大的規模經濟以及卓越的營運效率，構建了堅實的經濟護城河。其高達8分的專利壁壘和9分的成本優勢，使其在產業競爭中佔據有利地位。雖然品牌定價權（7分）和客戶轉換成本（6分）並非頂尖，但足以提供穩定的客戶基礎。網絡效應（3分）是其較弱環節。總體而言，SK海力士的護城河更偏向於「商品型」與「規模成本型」的結合，依賴於持續的技術創新和高效的資本配置（8分）來維持其競爭優勢，展現出相當的持久性（8分）。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"SK hynix has built a solid economic moat through its technological leadership in the memory sector, substantial economies of scale, and outstanding operational efficiency. Its high scores of 8 for patents and 9 for cost advantage position it favorably in industry competition. While brand pricing power (score 7) and customer switching costs (score 6) are not top-tier, they are sufficient to provide a stable customer base. Network effects (score 3) represent its weaker aspect. Overall, SK hynix's moat leans towards a combination of 'commodity-like' and 'scale-cost' advantages, relying on continuous technological innovation and efficient capital allocation (score 8) to sustain its competitive edge, demonstrating considerable durability (score 8).","evidenceHash":"ebc07a1e86c6d906a3f0f322a0553e9898ff32f53befc30401bdb9011d2ba9f8","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"KRW","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T03:29:05.434Z","evidenceHash":"77c9a69ce1da3359f11375dd0098bb5f82577ea005eba828cfc2203fb61a2a88"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"KRW","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T03:29:05.434Z","evidenceHash":"77c9a69ce1da3359f11375dd0098bb5f82577ea005eba828cfc2203fb61a2a88"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKHY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKHY.png","website":"https://www.skhynix.com","ceo":"Noh-Jung Kwak","full_time_employees":"36042","description":"SK hynix is one of the world's largest memory semiconductor companies and engages in the design, manufacture, and sale of advanced memory semiconductors. The company sells a wide variety of DRAM and NAND flash memory products with various configurations and performance characteristics tailored to meet application- and customer-specific needs.","description_en":"SK hynix is one of the world's largest memory semiconductor companies and engages in the design, manufacture, and sale of advanced memory semiconductors. The company sells a wide variety of DRAM and NAND flash memory products with various configurations and performance characteristics tailored to meet application- and customer-specific needs.","description_zh":"SK hynix Inc.（美股代碼：SKHY）為 Technology 領域之重要企業，專注於 Semiconductors 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"2091, Gyeongchung-daero, Bubal-eup","city":"Icheon-Si","state":"GY","zip":"17336","count